  "generated_description": "<div class=\"mountain-description prose prose-stone max-w-none\">\n  <p><strong>Crestone Peak</strong> is a 14,301-foot summit in Colorado. It has roughly 4,554 feet of topographic prominence. The Crestone Peak Trail is a 3.7-mile hike with about 1,362 feet of elevation gain. Nearby peaks include Crestone Needle, Kit Carson Mountain and Blanca Peak. Trail data is sourced from OpenStreetMap contributors (ODbL); verify current conditions with the official land manager before you go.</p>\n</div>",
